WEBVTT

00:16:28.070 --> 00:16:32.490
Danas, nije tako.

00:16:32.490 --> 00:16:36.351
Revolucija ljudske ravnopravnosti

00:16:36.351 --> 00:16:38.121
može da se dogodi.

00:16:38.121 --> 00:16:41.171
Događa se.

00:16:41.171 --> 00:16:43.037
I dogodiće se.

00:16:43.507 --> 00:16:48.129
Do koje mere
i koliko brzo, zavisi od nas.

00:16:48.129 --> 00:16:49.861
Hvala.

00:16:49.861 --> 00:16:52.577
(Aplauz)